        <details key="documentation" value="A hint to the client applications about when their data caches, if any, SHOULD&lt;203> be refreshed after a Refresh command changes the data on the server. The possible values are as follows:0 – Client applications are notified to refresh their caches only if a user query/interaction needs newer data.-1 (default) – Client applications are notified to allow all background cache refreshes."/>
